type: software
title: "UAVision: A Simulation Model for Real-Time Victim Detection and Terrain Exploration"
abstract: >-
  A simulation-first autonomous aerial search-and-rescue research platform.
  The project combines Unreal Engine/AirSim for high-fidelity perception and
  flight testing with a lightweight PyBullet curriculum for large-scale
  reinforcement-learning experiments. It includes depth-camera and LiDAR
  search agents, segmentation-based victim localisation, recurrent policies
  for partial observability, and a fog-of-war terrain exploration stack.
